```

## Type

type
```haskell
modifyLevel :: CollectSymbolState -> Integer -> CollectSymbolState
```

## Term

```haskell
1 0 0 294
modifyLevel stack oldLevel =
  let newStack = stack ++ popCurrentLevel oldStack
      newSStack = stack ++ popCurrentSStack oldStack
      newLevel = newStack { currentLevel = newLevel }
   in case stack of
        [] -> newSStack
        _ -> newSStack { currentLevel = newLevel }
```

